  - id: 266e944a-a4c7-4b64-a266-e2193c6cbcc2
    title: "----Oyun ak\u0131\u015F\u0131------ \xD6NEML\u0130"
    description: "Oyuncu ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7ta \xFClke ve \u015Fehir se\xE7erek
      oyunu ba\u015Flat\u0131r. Her \u015Fehrin farkl\u0131 \u015Firket kurma s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131
      bulunur. bulundu\u011Fu \u015Fehirde \u015Firketler kurar ve holdingini b\xFCy\xFCtmeye
      ba\u015Flar \xE7al\u0131\u015Fanlar al\u0131r \u015Fubeler kurar farkl\u0131
      \u015Fehirlere ve \xFClkelere a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r. Ara\u015Ft\u0131rmalar ile
      ekstra bonuslar ve a\xE7abilece\u011Fi farkl\u0131 \u015Firket sekt\xF6rleri
      kazan\u0131r."
    categoryId: 6200c9d8-d402-45c1-b81d-1dcc83a76214
    isCompleted: 0
    createdAtTicks: 639213840828538562
    completedAtTicks: 0
  - id: 4fa6fbf7-efd8-4eb0-87fb-e61ceebd9f29
    title: "Test Kodlar\u0131 ve haz\u0131r ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7lar"
    description: "yeni oyun a\xE7\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131nda \xFClkelerin ve di\u011Fer
      her \u015Feyin ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7 de\u011Ferlerini do\u011Frudan sizin
      Config'te belirledi\u011Finiz Economy, Tax ve Inflation de\u011Ferlerinden
      okuyup sisteme dahil etmesini sa\u011Flayacak"
    categoryId: 6200c9d8-d402-45c1-b81d-1dcc83a76214
    isCompleted: 0
    createdAtTicks: 639215432878258208
    completedAtTicks: 0
  - id: c8176688-b615-4f99-8500-3f03a0cf2e38
    title: "Research Point \u015F\xF6yle kullan\u0131lacak"
    description: "1. Headquarters - R&D Department (Ana Kaynak) \u2B50\u2B50\u2B50\u2B50\u2B50\n\nBu
      bence ana kaynak olmal\u0131.\n\nOyuncu Holding HQ'da Ar-Ge Merkezi kurar.\n\nHer
      seviye belirli miktarda RSP \xFCretir.\n\n\xD6rne\u011Fin:\n\nR&D Center Lv1
      = 5 RSP/g\xFCn\nR&D Center Lv2 = 12 RSP/g\xFCn\nR&D Center Lv3 = 22 RSP/g\xFCn\nR&D
      Center Lv4 = 35 RSP/g\xFCn\nR&D Center Lv5 = 50 RSP/g\xFCn\n\nBu pasif gelir
      olur.\n\n2. Research Employees \u2B50\u2B50\u2B50\u2B50\u2B50\n\nAr-Ge merkezine
      \xE7al\u0131\u015Fan atayabilirsin.\n\n\xD6rne\u011Fin:\n\nResearcher\nSenior
      Researcher\nScientist\nChief Scientist\n\nHer biri RSP \xFCretir.\n\n\xD6rne\u011Fin\n\nResearcher
      = +0.5 RSP/g\xFCn\n\nSenior = +1\n\nScientist = +2\n\nChief Scientist = +4\n\nSonra
      mutluluk, stres, y\xF6netici bonuslar\u0131 bunlar\u0131 etkiler.\n\nBu sistem
      senin mevcut \xE7al\u0131\u015Fan sisteminle m\xFCkemmel uyu\u015Fuyor.\n\n3.
      Universities \u2B50\u2B50\u2B50\u2B50\u2606\n\nBaz\u0131 \u015Fehirlerde \xFCniversite
      bonusu olabilir.\n\n\xD6rne\u011Fin\n\nBerlin\n\nTokyo\n\nBoston\n\nSeul\n\nLondra\n\ngibi
      \u015Fehirlerde\n\nResearch Production +15%\n\nveya\n\nResearch Speed +10%\n\nBu
      \u015Fehir se\xE7imini stratejik hale getirir.\n\n4. Company Categories \u2B50\u2B50\u2B50\u2B50\u2606\n\nBaz\u0131
      sekt\xF6rler do\u011Fal olarak Ar-Ge \xFCretir.\n\n\xD6rne\u011Fin\n\nSoftware\n\nAI\n\nBiotechnology\n\nSemiconductor\n\nSpace\n\n\u015Firketleri\n\nHolding'e
      ekstra RSP kazand\u0131r\u0131r.\n\n\xD6rne\u011Fin\n\nSoftware Company\n\n+0.2
      RSP/g\xFCn\n\nB\xF6ylece teknoloji \u015Firketleri sadece para i\xE7in de\u011Fil,
      ara\u015Ft\u0131rma i\xE7in de de\u011Ferli olur.\n\n5. Achievements / Milestones
      \u2B50\u2B50\u2B50\u2B50\u2B50\n\nEn sevdi\u011Fim sistem bu.\n\n\xD6rne\u011Fin\n\n\u0130lk
      \u015Eube\n\n+100 RSP\n\u0130lk 100 \xC7al\u0131\u015Fan\n\n+250 RSP\n\u0130lk
      Halka Arz\n\n+1000 RSP\n10 \u015Eehir\n\n+500 RSP\n\nBu oyuncuya s\xFCrekli
      \xF6d\xFCl verir.\n\nRSP \xFCretim form\xFCl\xFC\n\nBen olsam g\xFCnl\xFCk
      RSP \u015F\xF6yle hesaplan\u0131rd\u0131:\n\nToplam RSP/G\xFCn =\n\nHQ R&D\n+\nResearch
      Employees\n+\nCompany Bonus\n+\nCity Bonus\n+\nExecutive Bonus\n+\nEvent Bonus\n\nSonra\n\nResearch
      Speed\n\nayr\u0131 bir \xE7arpan olur.\n\nAra\u015Ft\u0131rma H\u0131z\u0131\n\nMesela\n\nResearch
      Speed = 135%\n\nolursa\n\n180 g\xFCn s\xFCren ara\u015Ft\u0131rma\n\n\u2193\n\nyakla\u015F\u0131k
      133 g\xFCnde biter.\n\nBu da ayr\u0131 bir geli\u015Ftirme alan\u0131 olu\u015Fturur.\n\nY\xF6neticiler\n\nSen
      zaten y\xF6netici sistemi yap\u0131yorsun.\n\nBence burada kullan\u0131lmal\u0131.\n\n\xD6rne\u011Fin\n\nCTO\n\nbonus\n\nResearch
      Speed +15%\nChief Scientist\nRSP Production +20%\nInnovation Director\nResearch
      Cost -10%\nD\xFCnya Etkinlikleri\n\nMesela\n\nGovernment Innovation Grant\n+50%
      RSP\nEconomic Crisis\nResearch Speed -20%"
    categoryId: 6200c9d8-d402-45c1-b81d-1dcc83a76214
    isCompleted: 0
    createdAtTicks: 639216455414036754
    completedAtTicks: 0
  - id: ef5c2a62-07ad-40e3-983b-f21b3b9c4b13
    title: "Gelecek g\xFCncellemelerde eklenecek"
    description: "Y\xF6netici Kalitesi (Rarity) (Expencive eklenebilir)\n\nBu, oyunun
      i\u015Fe al\u0131m sistemini \xE7ok daha ilgi \xE7ekici hale getirir.\n\nCommon\n\nRare\n\nEpic\n\nLegendary\n\n\xD6rnek:\n\nRarity\tBonus
      Say\u0131s\u0131\tBonus G\xFCc\xFC\nCommon\t1\tD\xFC\u015F\xFCk\nRare\t2\tOrta\nEpic\t3\tY\xFCksek\nLegendary\t4-5\t\xC7ok
      y\xFCksek\n\nB\xF6ylece iki farkl\u0131 CTO ayn\u0131 olmaz. Oyuncu daha iyi
      y\xF6neticileri bulmak i\xE7in i\u015Fe al\u0131m yapmaya devam eder, bu da
      oyunun tekrar oynanabilirli\u011Fini art\u0131r\u0131r."
    categoryId: 6200c9d8-d402-45c1-b81d-1dcc83a76214
    isCompleted: 0
    createdAtTicks: 639217031794373918
    completedAtTicks: 0
  - id: c45f4042-6ef0-4dd2-b096-ca7701f5becd
